        "name": "USN-8496-2",
        "description": "USN-8496-1 fixed a vulnerability in cifs-utils. Unfortunately, the fix introduced a regression with Kerberos mounts. This update reverts the security update until a complete fix is available.  We apologize for the inconvenience.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that cifs-utils incorrectly dropped root privileges  before looking up user information. A local attacker could possibly use  this issue to execute arbitrary code as the root user.",
        "aliases": []
      },
